     4441   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     4442   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('grp-code', 'Код группы', '',
     4443   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
